      "target": "../sections/sec-004-23-scope-of-the-policy-guidance.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Scope of the policy guidance \nThis document provides a pragmatic summary of the evidence and recommendations related to the \nuse of IGRAs in low- and middle-income countries and should be read in conjunction with the \ndetailed findings from the Expert Group Meeting Report.  \n \nThis policy guidance should be used to inform the use of IGRAs in low- and middle-income countries. \nIt is intended for National TB Programme Managers and Laboratory Directors, external laboratory \nconsultants, donor agencies, technical advisors, laboratory technicians, laboratory equipment \nprocurement officers, and pri",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines the scope of the policy guidance as a pragmatic summary of evidence and recommendations on IGRAs in low- and middle-income countries, intended for national TB programme managers and to be read with the Expert Group report.",
